{"n": 572, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "572.webp", "text": "32-6b\n\n32 13.006 FILLING AND BLEEDING\nPOWER STEERING\n\n1, Filling with Stopped Engine:\nFill oll tank up to \"MAX\" mark on\noll dipstick.\n\n2. Bleeding:\nTurn steering wheel two times each\nagainst left and right locks.\n\n3. Check oll level with engine stopped.\nAdd hydraulic fiuid* until level Is at\n“MAX” mark.\n\n* See Specifications\n\n32 13.060 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nPOWER STEERING GEAR\n~ Four Wheel Drive -\n\nProcedures are identica] with those for\nreplacing the front axle carrier — see\n3111001.\n\n32 13.060 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nPOWER STEERING GEAR\n\nRemove front wheels — see 36 10 340.\nRemove steering spindie — see\n\n32 31 070.\n\nNote\n\nCheck toe after installation — see\n\n32 00 004.\n\nimportant!\n\nDon't turn power steering as far as\nstop as this would damage radial oll\nseal.\n\nDraw hydraulic fluid* out of tank.\nUnscrew hydraulic fluld return pipe.\n\nimportant!\nNever reuse the drained oil.\n\nUnscrew pressure pipe.\nPlug connections with dust caps.\n\nInstallation\n\nReplace seais.\nTightening torque\".\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["32-6b", 0.46, 0.0371, 0.5299, 0.0603], ["32", 0.268, 0.0836, 0.2801, 0.0948], ["13.006", 0.2852, 0.0836, 0.3191, 0.0955], ["FILLING", 0.3262, 0.0836, 0.3688, 0.0955], ["AND", 0.3728, 0.0842, 0.3961, 0.0955], ["BLEEDING", 0.4007, 0.0842, 0.4574, 0.0955], ["POWER", 0.3262, 0.1001, 0.3678, 0.1114], ["STEERING", 0.3713, 0.1001, 0.4276, 0.1121], ["1,", 0.269, 0.134, 0.2771, 0.1446], ["Filling", 0.2857, 0.1326, 0.3181, 0.1479], ["with", 0.3222, 0.1333, 0.344, 0.1446], ["Stopped", 0.348, 0.1326, 0.3921, 0.1479], ["Engine:", 0.3961, 0.1333, 0.4357, 0.1479], ["Fill", 0.2857, 0.1499, 0.3009, 0.1605], ["oll", 0.3055, 0.1499, 0.3181, 0.1611], ["tank", 0.3222, 0.1499, 0.3445, 0.1611], ["up", 0.3485, 0.1525, 0.3622, 0.1638], ["to", 0.3658, 0.1505, 0.3759, 0.1611], ["\"MAX\"", 0.3799, 0.1499, 0.4144, 0.1611], ["mark", 0.4184, 0.1505, 0.4443, 0.1618]